@ECHO OFF
C:
IF NOT EXIST C:\WINDOWS\SYSTEM.INI GOTO NEW
C:\WINXT\WINBRDG.EXE RECOVER C:\WINDOWS
IF ERRORLEVEL 2 GOTO STOP
IF EXIST C:\WINDOWS\BRG.JRN GOTO RESUME
:NEW
IF EXIST C:\WINDOWS\WIN.COM GOTO FINISH
IF NOT EXIST C:\w30\SETUP.EXE GOTO SOURCE
IF NOT EXIST C:\WINXT\CGA.GR2 GOTO SOURCE
IF NOT EXIST C:\WINXT\FIXXT.EXE GOTO SOURCE
C:\WINXT\RESERVE.COM
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
CD \w30
ECHO Select Computer: Tandy 1000 EX/HX (WindowsXT).
ECHO Its preset selects HPXY 640x256 desktop, PC/XT Hold and COM1 wheel mouse.
ECHO Hardware panning is available through XYCTL after Windows starts.
C:\WINXT\SHOOK.COM
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
SETUP
C:\WINXT\SHOOK.COM /U
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
C:\WINXT\WINBRDG.EXE RECOVER C:\WINDOWS
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
GOTO FRESH
:RESUME
C:\WINXT\RESERVE.COM
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
C:\WINXT\WINBRDG.EXE RESUME C:\WINDOWS
C:\WINXT\WINBRDG.EXE RECOVER C:\WINDOWS
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
GOTO FRESH
:FINISH
IF NOT EXIST C:\WINDOWS\SYSTEM.INI GOTO STOP
IF NOT EXIST C:\WINDOWS\SYSTEM\KERNEL.EXE GOTO STOP
CD \WINXT
FIXXT INSTALL C:\WINDOWS C:\WINXT /XR1 %1
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
CPSET APPLY C:\WINDOWS %1 %2
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
GOTO LAUNCH
:FRESH
CD \WINXT
FIXXT INSTALL C:\WINDOWS C:\WINXT /XR1 %1 /FRESH
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
CPSET APPLY C:\WINDOWS %1 %2
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO STOP
:LAUNCH
ECHO Windows XT is ready. Starting the desktop.
WINXT.BAT
GOTO DONE
:SOURCE
ECHO Prepared Windows XT source or owned Windows 3.0 media is missing.
IF EXIST C:\WINXT\FIXXT.EXE C:\WINXT\FIXXT.EXE /FAIL
GOTO DONE
:STOP
C:\WINXT\FIXXT.EXE /FAIL
ECHO Installation stopped. Read the actual error; Windows was not started.
:DONE
